WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:07.000
Finding the right trainer for your team shouldn't mean chasing referrals across WhatsApp groups.

00:07.700 --> 00:12.970
Axon Arbor brings all your people development needs under one roof.

00:13.700 --> 00:21.530
Tell us a little about your organisation, your team size, location and what you're looking to solve.

00:22.300 --> 00:27.250
Describe what you need in your own words.

00:29.200 --> 00:35.400
We'll shortlist three relevant experts from our vetted network and explain why each could be a good fit.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.620
And an Axon Arbor expert will speak with you to help you choose the right one.

00:46.700 --> 00:53.880
Finding the right fit takes more than a database. It takes experts who understand people development.
